<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.3 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     900 million pesos  22.34 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     900 million pesos  23.61 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  23.63 pct</p>
<p>    350 days     600 million pesos  21.24 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 800 million pesos worth of 728-day Bondes.</p>
<p>It will also offer 150 million UDIs worth of the index-linked investment units known as UDIs. They will be for 1,050 days.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559</p>
